# VH.ROM carries Amstrad's 1985 letter-to-sound engine, which is not ours to
# pass on -- see ../LICENSE-NOTE.md. Neither it nor the rules it is built from
# belong in this repository.
VH.ROM
NRL.BIN
*.RAW
rasmoutput.sym

# VHLSAI.ROM is deliberately NOT ignored. It contains none of that engine --
# it asks the card instead -- so it is ours end to end and is tracked, like
# the disc images, as a built artefact anyone can use.
